    "rule": "geometry-only predicate fixed before any model score: source DOH AND geometry route_status standard AND 2000 m resolution AND projected length >= 500 m AND present in the accepted (safe-geometry) 18 inventory. Every qualifying segment is included whether or not it has records. Stable 18 segment IDs, never re-segmented. DRR/EXAT/nonstandard routes/short tails are unsupported (no prediction, never a fake zero)."
  },
  "labels": {
    "uid": "event_uid",
