    "segment_column": "segment_id_2000m",
    "date_column": "event_date",
    "block_column": "time_block",
    "years": [2021, 2022, 2023, 2024, 2025],
    "meaning": "y = number of retained 2021-25 MOT records with status_50m == matched AND segment_status == assigned to a universe segment, per segment x local day (or 6 h block). Zero means zero such SELECTED+LINKED records in the defined conditional population, NOT zero real accidents or complete reporting. Unknown / unmatched / unassigned / outside records are audited separately and never allocated as zero events."
  },
  "time": {
