    "caveat": "geoBoundaries gbOpen THA ADM1 (OpenStreetMap/Wambacher derived, year represented 2017, ODbL): NOT a current official administrative boundary. Polygons are never repaired; a midpoint covered by 0 polygons is unmapped and by >1 is ambiguous_border; both leave province context missing (never nearest centroid)."
  },
  "weather": {
    "buffer_hours": 6,
    "daily_block_label": "day",
    "note": "coarse province REPRESENTATIVE-POINT archived JMA GSM previous_day2 forecast (notebook 09 aggregates), joined through the segment midpoint polygon province. Not road/segment weather. Feature only when the variable is complete and latest nominal issue bound + 6 h <= target day - 1 at 18:00 local (notebook 10 policy); otherwise NaN with a reason. A nominal archive bound does not prove historical delivery."
  },
  "traffic": {
    "route_regex": "^[0-9]{1,4}$",
    "pad": 4,
    "note": "DOH annual survey-POINT AADT proxy grouped by DOH route + control section (current snapshot identity of the segment's source OID): mean/median of valid station totals and mean valid heavy share from the newest PRIOR survey year (< target year) whose catalog proxy available_from <= issue time. Station count is metadata only. Not live congestion, not per-segment exposure; survey-point KM is never forced onto segments; control sections may have changed historically."
  },
